1216
00:48:04,200 --> 00:48:08,680
Across four generations, the function

1217
00:48:06,640 --> 00:48:11,440
never moved.

1218
00:48:08,680 --> 00:48:13,760
What moved was the route the bytes took

1219
00:48:11,440 --> 00:48:16,040
through the memory hierarchy and which

1220
00:48:13,760 --> 00:48:18,000
