1221
00:48:16,040 --> 00:48:20,760
Tiling [music] kept the N by N score

1222
00:48:18,000 --> 00:48:23,280
matrix out of HBM entirely.

1223
00:48:20,760 --> 00:48:25,200
Online softmax made that legal, carrying

1224
00:48:23,280 --> 00:48:27,440
two running numbers per row in place of

1225
00:48:25,200 --> 00:48:29,520
waiting on the full one. Asynchrony let

1226
00:48:27,440 --> 00:48:30,853
the copies and the math overlap instead

1227
00:48:29,520 --> 00:48:31,160
of taking turns.

1228
00:48:30,853 --> 00:48:33,920
