a polynomial on the idle multiply-add

1231
00:48:36,680 --> 00:48:41,520
units routed the work around it.

1232
00:48:40,040 --> 00:48:43,800
The same pattern holds beyond the

1233
00:48:41,520 --> 00:48:45,440
kernel. Paging moved the cache without

1234
00:48:43,800 --> 00:48:47,680
