1235
00:48:45,440 --> 00:48:50,520
Splitting it across the chip let one

1236
00:48:47,680 --> 00:48:53,640
token read it in parallel. Graph replay

1237
00:48:50,520 --> 00:48:55,200
cut the bookkeeping between kernels.

1238
00:48:53,640 --> 00:48:56,600
None of those changed the model's

1239
00:48:55,200 --> 00:48:58,840
output.

1240
00:48:56,600 --> 00:49:00,000
Grouping and latent compression were the

1241
00:48:58,840 --> 00:49:01,720
exception.

1242
00:49:00,000 --> 00:49:04,120
They shrank the cache by changing the

1243
00:49:01,720 --> 00:49:06,600
model itself, what attention stores in

1244
00:49:04,120 --> 00:49:08,560
the first place.

1245
00:49:06,600 --> 00:49:11,560
We started with the tensor cores mostly

1246
00:49:08,560 --> 00:49:13,600
idle, [music] stalled waiting on memory.

1247
00:49:11,560 --> 00:49:15,440
By the end, they run at nearly three

1248
00:49:13,600 --> 00:49:17,360
